{"title":"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be the average of the three numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12b3565ecbec7de542b3290268b12d88d759a522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{2\\alpha}, \\sin{2\\beta} , \\sin(2\\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e1ea02bafb00d96b69babd26e3bf3dd115cd156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma = \\pi.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />\nExpress the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f1156b737a090f19124e417ba4850b475e24357.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = sin(\\alpha) sin(\\beta) sin(\\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\